erview_skills_Screenshot_01_2560X1440.png", "id": "307703721692608", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982516_307703725025941_2021162934857628277_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NYcQkg2vNcIQ7kNvwHhyo72&_nc_oc=Adqwx76VApdJWPVnpPo7ZV4n_PYW5F3dh_dXnY0lO14dyckjPy9IaqFrxnzhbcm9DTg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfyZqUtI-zPQt7xkT0nrA-l_9CFy1zZNgJTUXGhTSWiRGA&oe=69CCFBC3"}, "display_name": "VR Interview Skills", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Our Virtual Reality Interview Skills training package is designed to help candidates seeking employment significantly elevate their interview skills. This immersive VR training provides a hands-on experience for mastering interview techniques while building self confidence in the process. Participants can explore the VR environment at their own pace and engage in one-on-one conversations or formal panel interviews. \nA comprehensive pre-interview checklist initiates the process, guiding participants through crucial preparation steps. This tool prepares candidates for real-life job interviews. Real-time feedback and auditory cues foster a continuous learning environment, and the ability to revisit the VR interview simulation reinforces the learning process.\n\nKey Features and Learning Objectives:\n\u2022Two Interview Styles: Practice both informal interviews with one person and formal interview scenarios with two people.\n\u2022Realistic Interactions: The simulation incorporates a realistic question-and-answer flow that emulates real-world interviews. \n\u2022Expertly Crafted Content: Material researched and designed by subject matter experts.\n\u2022Embedded Learning Objectives: Ensures participants can recall, understand, and apply the necessary skills for successful real-life interviews. \n\u2022Seamless Navigation: Hand-tracking and voice-to-text are the primary navigation methods.", "short_description": "Our Virtual Reality Interview Skills training package is designed to help candidates seeking employment significantly elevate their interview skills. This immersive VR training provides a hands-on experience for mastering interview techniques while building self confidence in the process. Participants can explore the VR environment at their own pace and engage in one-on-one conversations or formal panel interviews.   "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.holopundits.com/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Holo Pundits", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.holopundits.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "271444722163646"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 0, "nodes": []}, "baseline_offer": null, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": []}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "9847679905296637", "version": "1.0"}, "id": "2948735865257312", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "6717971874934138", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "9847679905296637"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes